2026-10-08T11:43:36.3865569Z ok - first observation of a non-zero count is a POSSIBLY UNREPAIRED request (no longer a silent baseline)
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3866442Z ok - an increase attributes the delta
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3867043Z ok - unchanged attributes nothing
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3867883Z ok - a counter that went DOWN is a reset: the new count is all new drops
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3868586Z ok - a reset to zero (fresh master, no drops yet) attributes nothing
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3869334Z ok - a destination first seen on an INITIALIZED ledger counts fully
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3870184Z ok - counters are keyed per master: another master's first sighting also counts
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3870858Z ok - a request is recorded once per destination
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3871639Z ok - more drops on the same destination extend the entry, not duplicate it
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3872453Z ok - a destination matching a Slave resolves to its key
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3873065Z ok - an unmatched destination stays requested and unresolved
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3873735Z ok - a destination that is now a MASTER is voided, not demoted
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3874626Z ok - resolution accepts the bare host as well as host:port
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3875273Z ok - a gated request is HELD with its reason and produces no action
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3875725Z ok - a held request is not excluded from assignment (only a demoted one is)
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3876206Z ok - when the gate opens the held request becomes an action and the hold clears
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3876618Z ok - a demoted node is held out of assignment
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3876934Z ok - plan does not act twice on a demoted entry
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3877518Z ok - the mode on and following/initial_sync/disconnected/error own; needs_rebuild, idle, off and unreadable do not
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3878224Z ok - a COMPLETE reply without follower keys (tch, older flared) is NOT unreadable: not owned, ordinary repair
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3878820Z ok - at request time an unreadable follower is Unknown: neither owned nor not-owned
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3879310Z ok - holding records ownership, a visible reason, the bar and its epoch
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3879827Z ok - a later drop in the same epoch raises the bar and never lowers it; a new epoch replaces it
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3880351Z ok - an owned request is never planned for demotion while the gate is open
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3880785Z ok - a request held on an unreadable follower is not demoted either
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3881211Z ok - following at 99 keeps; following at 100 closes without a rebuild
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3881689Z ok - a BIGGER position in ANOTHER epoch does not close: it is a different number line
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3882582Z ok - a disconnected follower's position is not trusted for closing, but ownership continues
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3883194Z ok - a TRANSIENT stats failure keeps the hold and hands nothing over (no rebuild on a probe hiccup)
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3883745Z ok - after the hiccup a readable pass resumes: following past the bar closes
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3884246Z ok - needs_rebuild hands the entry to the ordinary path, keeping its drops and node key
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3885377Z ok - an owned entry with no recorded bar stays owned and is not closed by position
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3886596Z ok - ownership, bar and epoch survive the status round trip (an operator restart)
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3887337Z ok - a node still reporting the OLD version stays held
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3887850Z ok - a node reporting the demotion version is released, recording boot id, current id and drops at reseat
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3888378Z ok - unreadable stats change nothing (fail closed: stay held)
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3888836Z ok - Slave/Prepare is in progress, not complete
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3889603Z ok - Slave/Active with NO reconstruction newer than the reseat one (same boot, same id) is NOT completion (re-announced Active)
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3890782Z ok - a newer reconstruction still RUNNING is not completion
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3891650Z ok - a newer reconstruction that FAILED is not completion (last success is still #1)
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3892490Z ok - a newer success from a DIFFERENT source than the current master is not completion
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3893250Z ok - a newer reconstruction that SUCCEEDED from the current master completes and removes the entry
2026-10-08T11:43:36.3894672Z ok - failure then success: #3 succeeded after #2 failed → completion (cumulative counters would never match)
